{"server":"cn","storyId":"act20side_level_act20side_09_end","groupId":"act20side","stageId":"act20side_09","title":"穹顶之上","storyCode":"IC-9","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act20side/level_act20side_09_end.txt","sourceHash":"be187c5cd82760dc06b3ecb0d7c608a33fd09c1f295c32f2883165db263ce7e9","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g6_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克罗绮·砖石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，您说到这个的话，我也想起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克罗绮·砖石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几年前，我有参加过两次他和卡奇关于穹顶的竞稿会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克罗绮·砖石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那时，芬奇大师刚离开不久，而两个初露锋芒的新星都想用穹顶的改造方案证明自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克罗绮·砖石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡奇经常在会议上滔滔不绝，阐述自己的想法，解说自己设计的得意之笔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克罗绮·砖石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而斯第奇，会把他那些精美的图纸铺在桌子上，然后就退到一旁。他好像并不愿意花费精力在解释上，他希望我们能自己领悟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克罗绮·砖石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有的人喜欢卡奇的细致思路，也有的人认可斯第奇对自己作品的自信乃至自矜。他们无疑都当得起新星的称号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克罗绮·砖石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这场较量持续了几年，谁也没能真正获得多数人的认可，让自己的设计得以通过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克罗绮·砖石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到从某一次开始，斯第奇不再出现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芬奇还在的时候，曾经和我聊起过这个话题，他说，他很担心自己这个徒弟的将来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，你说的这些，旁人说再多也没有用，只有他自己想通，放下自己的傲慢，才有可能听取他人的意见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"否则，别说卡奇了，就算是嘉维尔那样强硬的人，恐怕也拿他没有办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克罗绮·砖石","speakerId":"avg_npc_566_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使嘉维尔真心想帮他，也不行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果真的有这样的办法，芬奇那老家伙应该早就尝试了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，谁知道呢......卡奇和嘉维尔在性格上完全相反，他们两个一起去帮斯第奇的话，或许真的会发生什么奇迹吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g8_malistroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，毕竟是祖玛玛的朋友，不能对这些家伙下重手还挺麻烦的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？对了，你们应该认识祖玛玛吧？我是她的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的机械","speakerId":"avg_npc_576_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖玛玛......确认身份，祖玛玛的朋友，嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的机械","speakerId":"avg_npc_576_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祖玛玛说过，不能伤害嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的机械","speakerId":"avg_npc_576_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不伤害嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，之前看那家伙跟你们玩得挺开心的，没想到提她还真的有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能帮我围住他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的机械","speakerId":"avg_npc_576_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不会伤害际崖城的居民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我只是要带他去他应该去的地方而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奇怪的机械","speakerId":"avg_npc_576_1","isRemote":false,"text":"了解。我们相信嘉维尔，我们帮助嘉维尔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别拦我的路！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇·画布，我问你一个问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我已经没有什么可跟你说的了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说了这么多，你讨厌际崖城的居民吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你不用回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你讨厌这里的居民，那你来到地上后，就该留在那里，你完全可以不告诉我们有关你部族的危机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你还是做了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你虽然不想修穹顶，但你依然割舍不下这里，所以你才会把特米米和依娜姆带下来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是又怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我很好奇，斯第奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有没有去问过那些否定你的人，他们为什么不喜欢你的方案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想也是，这就像你刚才说的那些话，肯定也从来没有告诉过身边的人一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"实际上，你真正的想法也还没有告诉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，有些话很难开口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的病人里也有不少死撑着不想告诉别人的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想给人添麻烦，觉得没人理解自己，就是嘴硬说不出口什么的，都有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但无论如何，不说的话，直到你死，都没人知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会说你做错了，斯第奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我要你试一试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真正的想法，到了现在，我真正的想法连我自己都已经不知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我至少也要......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔小姐，请等一等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡奇？你为什么会来这里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g4_durinsquare"},{"type":"narration","text":"广场上寂静无声。\n所有杜林都在聚精会神地倾听着阿芙朵嘉的故事。\n这个故事一开始温情脉脉，却逐渐显露杀机。\n当图穷匕见的那一刻，所有人都忍不住屏住呼吸，下一刻，又为她的幸存而松了口气。\n但这一切竟只是个开端，因为幸存是苦难与旅途的开始，她在这一路上看到了更多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......当我走到洞窟的尽头时，我一瞬间以为自己出现了错觉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果那不是一座充满金属光泽的升降梯，我甚至会以为那是迎接我通往死亡的阶梯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当时的心中甚至是喜悦的，因为我以为，自己的受难终于要结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我终于可以在死亡的怀抱中休息片刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我却没想到，那座升降梯，打开了我通往新生活的大门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以上，就是我在来到地下之前，所经历过的事情了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我所能为各位展示的，地面上的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它绝对称不上美好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，当我真正回头去看时，它又没有我所以为的那么糟糕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我之所以要先和各位说这些，想必有些聪明的人已经猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"根据我们的讨论结果，我们总结出了三套撤离方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一套，通过隧道进行撤离。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经过计算，即使我们立刻以最快的速度开始撤离，在爆发之前，恐怕也只能将七成的人口撤离到隧道那一头的兄弟城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果采用这套方案的话，我们就需要立刻开始行动，不能有任何耽搁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二套，立即动用全部资源，向着隧道的反方向，也就是另一边的空洞处进行挖掘，并开辟出一个安全的避难所临时使用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前看来，这套方案最终的存活率要高于上一套方案，但是，隧道是我们和其他城市的唯一连通方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灾难将会摧毁我们的大部分设施，在这种情况下，且不论开辟的避难所能否容纳全城的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使真的可以救下所有人，在灾难过去之后，我们能够坚持多久也将是一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而第三套方案......则是前往地面。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经过工业代表的估算，那座工业升降梯在经过短时间的扩建后，可以做到在爆发前将全城人口都转移到上方的洞窟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而前一段时间来到际崖城的几位客人，正是来自位于际崖城正上方的地表之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那里是一片名叫阿卡胡拉的茂盛雨林，她们作为那里的管理者，愿意为际崖城的居民提供居住的空间以及各种帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等到灾难过去，我们安顿下来之后，可以到时候再选择返回这里，或者另做打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"目前看来，第三套方案，是风险最小，最能够让所有人都活下来的方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我们要做一个对杜林来说，可能是前所未有的决策——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前往地面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才我讲述的，关于我的故事，也是为此而讲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们依然有别的选择，我不希望大家被我的话影响判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因此，我选择将我的故事讲出来，由大家自行判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，依照惯例，十分钟后，我们将开始对三种方案的表决。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g8_malistroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有些话想要跟斯第奇说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"穹顶交给你不是正好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是现任设计代表，大家又喜欢你，由你来设计新的穹顶肯定会被大家接受吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从当年延续至今的较量，你赢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我要说的不是这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是来向你道别的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样的，在芬奇大师离开后，设计代表的职位一直只是由我代理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我在接过这个重担之后，愈发感觉到我的能力或许并不足以承担这份责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，我一直都想去把芬奇大师找回来，只有他，才是我们这座城市真正的设计代表。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我走后，最适合接替这个位置的，显然就是身为芬奇大师弟子的你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在刚才，我回了一趟设计部，完成了一些工作交接，已经打算收拾行李出发了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么是现在？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说了要前往地上的事，刚才我路过广场的时候，听到阿芙朵嘉小姐的演讲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个提案我想最终一定会被通过吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但芬奇大师应该身在某座杜林城市里，所以，我想趁着现在还能通行，先赶去隔壁城市安顿下来再做打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以很遗憾，我应该是没有办法参与穹顶的设计了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你做这种事，以为我会感谢你吗，卡奇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这么做不是为了被你感谢，斯第奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而是我真的觉得你可以胜任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你缺少的，只是一个让别人认识你的机会，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯第奇愤怒地想要向卡奇挥拳。\n然而，拳在半空中，就无力地落下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师突然离开，我知道他想要让我独立起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这么做，我知道你也想让我再尝试一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔也是，我知道你们是好心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，老师也是，你也是，嘉维尔也是，为什么你们都想要逼我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你们就不能把我放着不管！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么就不能让我继续躲下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么你们都要对我这么友善！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡奇默默捡起旁边的设计图，递给斯第奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你明明那么努力过了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡奇·叙光","speakerId":"avg_npc_567_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该可以做得更好的，斯第奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对别人好哪里需要什么理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不想看人堕落下去又需要什么理由？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，站起来，斯第奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别哭丧着脸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在一开始欺骗了我的族人，而且现在，你也给不少人添了麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我要给你一拳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忍着点，不会很痛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_i09"},{"type":"narration","text":"看着嘉维尔举起的拳头。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_i09"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯第奇在一瞬间，想起了许多事。\n老师给他上课时他的喜悦。\n老师离开后他的悔恨。\n每次竞稿失败时，从设计部走出来的不甘。\n不知不觉间，当他抬头看向穹顶时，比起斗志，反而心生愤怒。\n他认为这些情感都是自己的，没有人会理解他，他也不需要别人的理解。\n但此时此刻，当他意识到，有人在如此真切地想要了解他，帮助他时。\n他才真正明白，他或许确实应该放下一些什么了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他想，自己确实应该受这一拳。\n“轰！”\n然而，预想之中的疼痛并没有到来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g8_malistroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"他低头看去，看到桌上有一个深深的拳印。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，现在知道怕了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我的拳头只会用来砸坏人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你小子又不是坏人，只是脑子不太好使，我打你干什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才脑子不好使！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，还有心情还嘴，看来情绪还可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，现在愿意跟我走一趟了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g4_durinsquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，现在开始表决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同意第一套方案的人，请举手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"广场上，稀稀拉拉地举起了不少手。\n他们表情很镇定，仿佛明知举手的人不会多，他们也依然这样选择。\n而阿芙朵嘉知道，会这么选择的杜林人，总是愿意成为被牺牲的那一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请记录员记录下同意第一套方案的人数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好了，请放下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同意第二套方案的人，请举手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这一次，举手的人多了许多，其中不少还握着酒瓶。\n他们大多体格魁梧，显然，他们对于挖掘十分有自信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请记录员记录下同意第二套方案的人数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好了，请放下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"同意第三套方案的人，请举手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n广场上一片寂静。\n没有人举手。\n阿芙朵嘉知道，这也是理所当然的事，前往地面，如此重大的决定，不是她一个人一段演讲就能轻易说动的。\n但看着底下窃窃私语的杜林人，她知道，她的故事并非没有起效。\n杜林们并非恐惧，他们只是需要一个契机。\n现在，还需要再推一把。\n她在心中暗自感到罪恶。\n过去的她，一定会是最反对前往地面的人。\n现在的她，却要为了这件事做其他杜林的工作。\n但罪恶感马上消失殆尽，因为她知道，自己正在做自己认为正确的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关于前往地面，我还有一些补充说明要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿卡胡拉是一片湿润的雨林，那里四季的气温都不低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使没有温控系统，我们也应该能适应那里的生活。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，阿卡胡拉拥有丰富的湖泊资源，以及一座天然的瀑布，也就是说那里是一个天然的“大水坑”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，阿卡胡拉也有丰富的矿物资源和土地，如果我们想的话，完全可以在那里重建一座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，还有我们际崖城最骄傲的，能让大家重新焕发笑容的新地标！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，这一点需要和阿卡胡拉的领导者讨论之后才能够决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"依娜姆应该会同意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，阿芙朵嘉，我给你把人带来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇啊，我看你们讨论得差不多了，接下来到讨论修穹顶的事情了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来的时机应该刚好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你来的完全不是时候！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，行吧。反正呢，虽然我不是阿卡胡拉的领袖，但我还是代替她说一声，阿卡胡拉欢迎杜林的各位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你赶紧给我下来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我再说两句啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心动的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔和那些地上人，确实都是些很有意思的家伙啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"理性的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，而且，她们不仅善良，同时也很强大，和她们交朋友是个不错的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢快的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也觉得！而且阿卡胡拉居然还有个更大的“大水坑”，难道还有比这更有意思的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"理性的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是冷静下来想想，这可能会影响杜林整个族群的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"心动的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_573_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我在这个未来中没有看到什么无法接受的后果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢快的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我也觉得，虽然阿芙朵嘉故事中的地面和我们听说的一样，有许多不好的事情在发生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"理性的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_575_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果那些事情最后依然塑造了阿芙朵嘉这样一个善良的人，我不认为我们有什么惧怕的必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢快的杜林人","speakerId":"avg_npc_574_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何况，传言中地面上还有仍在连载中的《奇谈怪论》哦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g6_reception"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔，你知不知道我为了这一刻花了多少功夫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是因为你出来打岔，最后大家决定不去地面了怎么办？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......但是我刚才扫了一眼，我在杜林人的脸上看到的是向往和期待，他们会同意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经说服他们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿芙朵嘉","speakerId":"avg_4055_bgsnow_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个人，真不知道你到底为什么总是这么乐观......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，嘉维尔，斯第奇怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他说，他愿意试试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"avg_1026_gvial2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是看到他还留在广场，所以问一问你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看起来，他确实想要试一试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也去帮他一把吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_g4_durinsquare"},{"type":"narration","text":"广场上人山人海，大家都在议论着有关前往地面的事。\n这似乎与他无关，他应该跟着嘉维尔一起进入房间，因为他过去就十分不适应这种场合。\n但他没有动。\n他知道，自己不是在害怕。\n他知道，自己的心中有一股冲动，他想要说些什么。\n只是，他不知道如何开口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，忘了和各位说一个遗憾的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的代理设计代表，卡奇·叙光，在得知了际崖城即将毁灭的消息后，决定辞去现在的职务，与我们暂时分道扬镳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他决定要前去寻找如今不知去向的前设计代表，芬奇·画布大师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对于他的决定，我表示理解并尊重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"并且，他在离开前就已经指名，由芬奇大师的弟子，斯第奇·画布来接任他的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我也深知，斯第奇·画布是一名才华横溢的建筑设计师，所以同意了他的请求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正好，现在就由他来向大家说几句吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯第奇，你来讲两句。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我知道各位可能并不了解我，只知道我的老师，是大名鼎鼎的芬奇·画布。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我和老师的风格并不相同，老师的风格更讲究对物欲的对抗，而我的风格则更倾向于——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我想说的不是这个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想说的是，前往地面的方案我刚才听到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，这对于大家来说不是一个容易做出的决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也认为，这是最安全的方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果选择这个方案的话，我们还有时间对城市的遗容进行修缮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能做的事情不多，但是，我愿意在最后的时间里尽可能设计出一个穹顶的修缮方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，如果可能的话，我还想通过这个方案把穹顶变得更加坚固。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然抵御活性化了的源石矿脉爆发是不可能的，但是，应该能为我们争取更多的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，各位，让我们一起去地表吧，老师......一定也会这么想的。"},{"type":"narration","text":"台下寂静无声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯第奇·画布","speakerId":"avg_4054_malist_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低声）耶奇大师，我是不是说错话了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你说得非常好，好小子，我就知道你能行的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"耶奇·地心","speakerId":"avg_npc_564_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，关于第三套方案的选择，重新表决吧，各位。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_i11"},{"type":"narration","text":"像是被斯第奇的话统一了意见一般，下一刻，一只，两只，三只......无数只手举了起来。\n他们喊着各种各样的话语，斯第奇听不太清。\n但他隐隐约约听到了一些夸赞他的声音。\n他看到，远处的高台上，卡奇在对他微微挥手，似是在对他祝贺。\n他感到身上仿佛有电流窜过。\n他第一次体会到，被人认同，是一件这么让人心潮澎湃的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
